# Host bind-mount base path for the knowledge backend's persistent data.
# Set KNOWLEDGE_RES_DIR in the main .env (project root) — docker-compose.knowledge.yml
# reads it from there and creates a db/ subdirectory underneath.
#
# Default: "." (current directory). Point this to a large-capacity disk for
# production, e.g.:
#   KNOWLEDGE_RES_DIR=E:/DockerRes/nyaachat-knowledge     (Windows)
#   KNOWLEDGE_RES_DIR=/srv/DockerRes/nyaachat-knowledge   (Linux)
#
# See also: the main .env.example in the project root.
KNOWLEDGE_RES_DIR=.
